@rephorsford reminds us that while Democrats are prioritizing investments in future generations, Republicans prioritized tax cuts for the rich.

On Wednesday, July 20 at 10:30 am ET, the House Budget Committee held a hearing titled, "Examining the Powerful Impact of Investments in Early Childhood for Children, Families, and Our Nation’s Economy." 

For more information: https://budget.house.gov/legislation/hearings/examining-powerful-impact-investments-early-childhood-children-families
